[79.273709, "o", "+----+------+-----+-----------+\r\n| ID | name | age | is_active |\r\n+----+------+-----+-----------+\r\n| 1  | Alex |  30 |    True   |\r\n+----+------+-----+-----------+\r\n"]
[79.275861, "o", "Введите команду: "]
