[98.443096, "o", "+----+-------+-----+-----------+\r\n| ID |  name | age | is_active |\r\n+----+-------+-----+-----------+\r\n| 1  |  Alex |  31 |    True   |\r\n| 2  | Maria |  27 |   False   |\r\n+----+-------+-----+-----------+\r\n"]
[98.448922, "o", "Введите команду: "]
